        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Grant Success Story: Aquatic Facility Conceptual Design</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47465.webp" alt="Grant Success Story: Aquatic Facility Conceptual Design" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p><a href="https://www.tetonvalleyaquatics.org/the-project" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Teton Valley Aquatics</a>, with their partner, the <a href="https://driggsidaho.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">City of Driggs</a>, hired architecture firm Cushing/Terrell to complete the conceptual designs of the Aquatics Center with the help of a $5,000 Competitive Grant award from the Community Foundation of Teton Valley. Working with a firm to develop drawings and costs and engaging the public for feedback is crucial to go after more significant donations and grants. Teton Valley Aquatics will be able to use these designs to show to future donors and grantors to help fundraise for their capital campaign.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Teton Valley Aquatics&#8217; survey showed conceptual designs and helped gather feedback from the community. Here are a few quotes from that survey. </p>

<blockquote>
<p>The entire project is awesome. I really like the outdoor spa. Geothermal pools would be incredible.”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>

<blockquote>
<p><br>I love how light and airy the space looks and that there is a separate lap and play/therapy pool.”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>

<blockquote>
<p>In terms of the aquatics I love the lap pool and outdoor spa &#8211; both will see loads of use. Quite honestly, I am most excited about having a recreation facility available to the valley which could provide much needed space for folks to connect and focus on wellness.”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>

<blockquote>
<p>Let’s do this Teton Valley!!!!”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>

<blockquote>
<p>The space considers all kinds of water activities that will serve the community. The spa is an extra luxurious bonus.”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>

<div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div>

<blockquote>
<p>I think it will be a great addition to the valley.”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>

<blockquote>
<p>Pretty darn exciting, however it shakes out. The focus and energy of leadership at Teton Valley Aquatics is very much noticed and appreciated!”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>

<blockquote>
<p>“Love it! Thank you!”</p>
<cite>Survey Participant</cite></blockquote>
